                                "tr": "O ucuz restorandaki yemek kesinlikle <w>iğrençti</w>.",
                                "de": "Das Essen in diesem billigen Restaurant war absolut <w>ekelhaft</w>."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "He has a <w>disgusting</w> habit of chewing with his mouth open.",
